"""A shell/command-line feature, usually negative and otherwise near zero.

Commands and their operators, Unix executable paths, shell expansions, and
script/build/configuration filenames trigger it. Recent shell grammar
strengthens ambiguous words and dollar signs; PHP syntax suppresses that
interpretation. A bounded text window and word-boundary checks temper
ambiguous word fragments. Recognizable military/film phrases are damped;
'exit code' gets a small positive response. These are approximate rules,
not a parser.
