programs.sol:
"""A multilingual 'and/or' detector, not a general conjunction parser.

Match connective words and particles. For English and/or, punctuation, numbers,
function words and the preceding word's length adjust the strength. Recent
Romance versus English function words distinguish Spanish/Portuguese/Italian
conjunctions from the letters y and e; Turkish cues disambiguate ve. Chinese
word+和 tokens fire especially strongly. Unrecognized tokens predict zero;
this omits weak lexical variation.
"""
import math
import re

READS = ()
NUMBERS = set('''zero one two three four five six seven eight nine ten eleven
    twelve thirteen fourteen fifteen sixteen seventeen eighteen nineteen twenty
    first second third fourth fifth sixth seventh eighth ninth tenth hundred
    thousand million billion'''.split())
FUNCTION = set('''a an the this that these those it its they them their he him
    his she her i me my we us our you your who whom whose what which where
    when why how is are was were be been being am do does did have has had
