"""A partial lexical detector for electronics and low-level C code.

Firmware APIs and hardware interfaces get large responses; circuit/control
words and C routines get smaller ones. A recent-electronics flag boosts
ambiguous words such as board and pin. It decays 4% per token and resets
between documents. Camera/console brands have a moderate response. Token fragments also fire
outside their original meaning
(bed in embedded/testbed, asonic in ultrasonic/Panasonic, ystick in joystick,
adget in gadget). Tool-call markup receives small signed offsets.
"""
